WEBVTT

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.580
Looking good.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:11.000
"Money x Bonds"

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:15.040
Morning! Genzo, this morning let's...

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:18.910
Good boy... You're so cute!

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.160
Carmilla came home in
the morning again, huh?

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.120
Jeez.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:28.700
Everybody's the same as usual today.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.620
For now, I'm making breakfast!

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:34.290
Genzo!

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:39.000
What, you're back, Katherine?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.330
It's Altena!

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.830
I'm the princess of a kingdom!

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:42.910
Very noble!

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.330
Why do you keep forgetting?

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.580
'Cause I don't care.

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.620
Rude!

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.500
Well, for now, I'm not
going to worry about it.

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:58.500
Genzo, today I need you to promise
you'll do your duty as a hero.

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.000
I refuse!

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.830
You never learn, do you?

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.950
You're like an obsessive stalker.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.120
Who are you calling a stalker?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.910
Oh, Shigure, can you get me the salt?

00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:13.870
The breakfast in this household
is always so bland...

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.290
You're really rude.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:22.330
Now that we've all finished our meal,

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:23.830
Genzo...

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.160
What?

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:27.040
According to my knights,

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.290
the Demon King from another world
attacked a village of orcs nearby...

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:35.290
Oh, yeah. The orcs said the same thing.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:39.620
What's this Demon King like, you think?

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:43.080
What? You knew, and yet
you still did nothing?

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.450
His name was MAO, yeah...

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:50.750
You know him?

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.830
Genzo! Genzo!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:56.080
What's the Demon King
from another world like?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.540
Well, he was MAO,
that's all I can say...

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.160
It's an obvious lie, Mistress.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:06.290
Even if Genzo is a monster without
a trace of compassion in him...

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:11.250
What kind of life did you live where
you got to know the Demon King, Genzo?

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.120
Listen to me!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.620
I don't know why he did it,

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:18.200
but this Demon King from another
world mercilessly struck down

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:20.290
the orcs on his own side.

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:23.540
There's no telling what other
horrible things he may do!

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.040
You're right, actually.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:28.040
Well, that's how you can tell
he's from another world.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:31.700
He doesn't care about friendship
between us monsters at all.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.200
"Us monsters"?

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.540
No, it's nothing.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:44.790
It's possible that the people of
this town may be his next target.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:45.870
So...

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:52.910
Altena...

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.080
Yes?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:59.580
I want to take Hiroyuki for
a walk. So please move.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:08.040
You can shake like a newborn deer,
but I still won't love you.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.580
What's wrong?

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:18.580
Hiroyuki's gone!

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.870
Where's the hero?

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:26.790
From the way the orcs
reacted, he must be close.

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:29.330
Knock it off!

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.830
Come on, show me!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.120
What's wrong? What are you doing?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.120
Cut it out, man.

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:38.250
Joanna! Get this!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.910
He nabbed something from the orc village.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.040
Are you stupid?
I mean it! Are you that dumb?

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.080
I'm sure it's something naughty!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:48.120
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:51.250
Naughty? I don't understand.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.950
But let me see it.

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.120
'Kay.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.700
What are you showing my lady?

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:07.040
This angle. This bridge.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.700
It's him!

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:14.250
I've finally found you,
Animal Mask! Genzo Shibata!

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:19.250
Joanna, this is Carmilla, too!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:23.540
She probably fell under
the hero's sway, just like the orcs!

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:28.410
She's just a lesser vampire.
And her mistress is worthless anyway.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.620
I'm sure Lindabulea also...

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:33.080
Yes, that's doubtless the case.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:37.660
I'll avenge your defeat.
It's the least I can do.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.790
Aww, they took it from us.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.410
It had all that stuff about "death grip"
and "unbearable shame."

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.870
It was probably really naughty.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:56.540
Hiroyuki! Hiroyuki!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:58.540
Where are you?

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.620
Genzo!

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.120
Have you seen Hiroyuki?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:07.160
No...

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.620
I see.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.750
Bye.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.700
Hey, Hiroyuki!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:19.790
Normally Genzo would notice
that I changed my shampoo.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.700
What am I thinking? How silly of me!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.080
Hiroyuki!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.250
Come out!

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:32.250
Hiroyuki!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:33.290
Mistress.

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:36.750
That animal doesn't matter, does it?

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:41.620
Carmilla, Genzo does a lot for us!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.250
We have a responsibility
to help him look for Hiroyuki.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:51.540
And he's very important
to me... as well...

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:53.120
Mistress.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:55.870
Um, excuse me?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.250
Oh, Princess Buttocks--
I mean, Princess Altena!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.580
Have you seen anybody named
Hiroyuki around here?

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.660
Actually it's an animal,
a brown beast about this size...

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.870
No, not really.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.580
I see!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:13.950
Look! It's Princess Buttocks!

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.870
Princess Buttocks! Princess Buttocks!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:29.250
The scent drops off around here.

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:33.040
Was he taken away in a bag
or some kind of box?

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:36.370
Which would mean
the crime was planned...

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:40.330
Oh, is something wrong, Shigure?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:44.330
Clause! Well, actually...

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.540
You saw Hiroyuki?

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:57.870
Yes. I saw him when I was visiting
a certain noble's mansion today.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.080
What's he doing at a noble's mansion?

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.830
Who cares?

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.120
Let's go!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.870
Wait for me, Hiroyuki!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.870
Wait, Genzo!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.410
I'm coming for you!

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:10.200
I'll bring you back!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.290
Hiroyuki!

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.450
Hey!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:14.250
I'm on my way!

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:27.700
Over here, Catherine!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:34.750
Maria, why don't you
give Catherine a treat?

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:36.870
Okay, Daddy!

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:38.620
Let's go, Catherine!

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:41.830
Don't trip!

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.660
Why should I give her back?

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:50.410
I paid a high price to buy her
from a merchant this morning.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:53.370
And Catherine's taken
a liking to my Maria.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:58.040
His name's Hiroyuki!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.580
Somebody stole him!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.120
Not my problem.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.750
She's now Catherine.
My animal. That I bought.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:11.830
Um, Hiroyuki was originally ours,
and we'd like him back.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:15.620
Shigure, what he's saying isn't wrong.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:17.830
But...

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:24.290
Even if Hiroyuki was stolen, if he bought him
without knowing that, he did nothing wrong.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.160
I don't know what's going on,
but that's brilliant, Mistress!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.250
You keep your mouth shut.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:34.580
Then there's no problem
if we buy him back, right?

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.700
You're Princess Buttocks...

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.120
Silence!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.120
How much did you pay?!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:45.000
This is the receipt from
when I purchased him.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.080
It's so expensive...

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.290
Father, Catherine just...

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.700
Hiroyuki!

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.790
Is it yummy, Catherine?

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.160
Father, she says it's yummy!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.120
I'm sure it is!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:22.580
I had my chefs make it
for her especially.

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:24.870
Hiroyuki...

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.370
This is the perfect chance
to get Genzo in my debt!

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.700
There should be enough money
in the castle treasury...

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:37.160
If I buy back that little animal,

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:41.410
Genzo will have to do what I tell him!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.910
Now I can get him to
do his duty as hero!

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.750
We're leaving, Shigure.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.660
You're sure, Genzo?

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.500
We don't have a choice.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.790
We don't have the money.

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:59.160
I'm glad you understand. Now go.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:03.870
Genzo...

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:07.410
Genzo...

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.040
Are you... crying?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.660
What a wuss!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:23.700
Be happy, Hiroyuki!

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:32.080
Um, was Catherine your dog?

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.450
Yes.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:36.950
He's been with me through
so much sorrow and joy.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:38.950
He's a part of my family!

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:45.500
Father...

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.500
What is it, Maria?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:51.450
Can I give Catherine back to him?

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:55.290
What are you saying, Maria?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:59.660
Listen, I paid for her--

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:03.450
If I'd had Catherine
ever since I was little,

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:08.160
and then she went to another
person's house, I'd be sad!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:11.700
And I think she's very sad now!

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.700
So...

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.620
But...

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:20.620
Well, if that's how it's going to be...

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:24.080
No, I can't let you have her for free!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:26.750
I paid all this money!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.290
I need at least half...

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.410
Half? Even that's too much...

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.540
Father!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:41.910
You're ten years too young to look
at a man with eyes like that, Maria...

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.750
Okay, half of the half, then!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:58.950
No, half of that!
Actually, half of that!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:02.250
And another half... and another half...

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:05.080
And yet another half...
and another half...

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:10.750
One more half!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.950
You have to pay that much!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:18.450
If you don't have that much money,
Catherine is better off at our home!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.910
Father!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:27.410
But we still don't have that kind of money!

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:32.790
Mistress, look at what
Genzo did to my stomach!

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:37.040
Please rub this painkiller lotion on it...

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:41.620
Let your pretty fingers
run across my belly...

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.910
What do we do?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:48.000
Without money, Hiroyuki will...

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.160
Maria was a nice child, wasn't she?

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.790
Genzo?

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:58.580
Hiroyuki may be happy with her.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.250
He can have his fill of yummy food...

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.540
What's gotten into you?!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:08.790
That's what I really wanted
to do with my pet shop.

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.580
Meeting an animal.
Interacting with them.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.160
Sharing in their joys...

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:16.290
So maybe I'm better
off letting him go...

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:22.450
Are you really sure, Genzo?

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.660
Give me a second.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.120
What's this money?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.370
I didn't know we had
so much in this house...

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:44.410
I was saving it in case
we ever needed it.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:49.450
I knew if I told you about it,
you'd just spend it all.

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:52.830
You can use it to buy back Hiroyuki.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.450
Shigure...

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.830
It's fine.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:16:00.790
I was hoping we could use it
to open the pet shop, but...

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:08.040
Whether we use it now or use it in
the future, it's still there to help you.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.700
It's a deal, then.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:14.580
Bye-bye, Catherine.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.700
His name's Hiroyuki.
Come by and play sometime.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:24.370
Um, can I ask something?

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.370
Who was the merchant
who sold you Hiroyuki?

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.620
There were three of them actually,
and they were quite strange.

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:36.830
A bearded man with an eye patch.
A wolf beastman and a cat beast woman.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.700
I didn't think it would go this well!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:48.660
I heard he was running around
the whole town crying!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:52.200
Why am I being petted?

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.910
It just feels right.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:57.120
I haven't had such
good drink in a while!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.790
Drink, drink! This is
the drink of victory!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:00.870
Gulp it all down--

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.580
So you thought you could
sell Hiroyuki, did you?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:12.370
You're not even worth petting anymore!

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:21.450
I just spent all the money to open
this shop you're smashing up, too!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.500
You pervert!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.870
I can hear my bones snapping!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:39.450
Please forgive me!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.200
Nope!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.750
Genzo!

00:17:50.910 --> 00:17:53.580
I've avenged you, Hiroyuki!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.290
They're not dead, right?

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.410
I'm back, Genzo!

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:03.290
Now use this money to...

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.370
Huh?

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.120
Okay, Hiroyuki.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:15.410
It's dangerous out there,
so sleep in my bed tonight!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.290
What's wrong?

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:21.700
That's...

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.200
Mr. Birdy! Mr. Woof!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.290
What are these demon beasts doing here?

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.950
Genzo, did you bring home even more...?

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.750
This smell...

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.410
Somebody's inside our home.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.120
I've been waiting.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:45.080
Lindabulea, I never thought
we'd meet again like this.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.660
Um...

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.410
Did you forget again...

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:50.080
My name is Draculius Joanna Joannascore...

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:55.500
We meet again, Genzo Shibata.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:55.500
My name is Draculius Joanna Joannascore...

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.540
No, Animal Mask!

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:03.120
He's the one who attacked
the orc village?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.790
Then this...

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.450
Hey, MAO.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.000
I thought you were lying!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.450
But you really do know
the Demon King from another world?

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.160
Yeah, I do.

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:21.580
So it was you who summoned the
Demon King from another world?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:26.700
And what about you? You should be
defeating the hero, not living with him.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:29.330
You're a traitor to our lord.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.700
That's right!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:34.750
Well, I've got my reasons, I guess...

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:40.370
I bet you lost to the hero and begged
him to save your life, right?

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:42.080
Cowardly!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.410
Hey, you don't get to talk
about her like that!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.200
Shut up, lesser vampire!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.910
Know your place!

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:51.370
Stop talking!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.040
Let's have a match!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.950
Fight me!

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:57.700
That's why I'm here!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:01.410
Joanna, what's a "match"?

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:07.790
I'll tell you. A "match" is a... a battle
to the death they do in other worlds!

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:10.370
Two men enter, one man ends up dead!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.500
What?

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:16.000
Lindabulea, I challenge you to a "match," too.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.290
Joanna!

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:21.080
Um, I don't know who you are.

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:23.250
But you're bothering
the neighbors, so quiet down...

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.370
That's a good idea.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.700
C-Clause! Where did you come from?

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:33.870
I was thinking it's about time
for a second tournament.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.660
We're doing that again?

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.790
A fighting tournament? Perfect!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:43.870
I'll bury you in front of a huge crowd!

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:48.200
This time, don't run when
you fight me, Animal Mask!

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.500
This time, I'll pay you back
for what you did!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.410
Fight me, Lindabulea!

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:56.910
Mistress, we can't lose this fight!

00:20:56.910 --> 00:21:01.830
Another tournament?
Will there be more yummy food?

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.200
Let's do it! This is our
chance to be rich, Genzo!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.000
Pay you back, huh?

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:15.160
Very well!

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.580
It's a fight, MAO!

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:30.750
MAO... I'm up against
a real pro wrestler!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:34.040
A totally different fight than
the amateurs I've battled thus far.

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:43.450
Carmilla? What's wrong?

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:50.250
There's someone I need to beat.

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:54.500
And I'm willing to do whatever it takes.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:55.750
Genzo!

00:21:55.750 --> 00:22:00.330
Please... please teach me pro wrestling!

00:22:07.450 --> 00:22:08.910
Very well.

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:49.790
Next time: "Pride x Loyalty."
